<title>SINGAPORE: SSingTel sees double digit growth.</title>
<headline>SSingTel sees double digit growth.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Telecom said on Friday despite slower than anticipated growth forecasts in the next two quarters, it is confident of maintaining its double digit earnings growth forecast for the full year.</p>
<p>The company said this in a statement with its financial results for the six months to September 30, 1996.</p>
